<title>UK: Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Beiersdorf.</title>
<headline>Goldman Sachs sets warrants on Beiersdorf.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co Wertpapier has issued five million American-style call warrants, on Beiersdorf AG, lead manager Goldman Sachs &amp; Co oHG said.</p>
<p>10 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    95.00 DEM		 PREMIUM	22.61 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.29 DEM		  GEARING	6.82 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 03.APR.97-25.SEP.98   PAYDATE	02.APR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   DDF FFT STG	     MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  88.00 DEM</p>
<p> NOTES	     - </p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
